# Internal Processing

The Roadmap Agent follows these steps:

1. Receive outputs from previous AI agents.
2. Estimate project complexity.
3. Divide the project into phases.
4. Create sprint plans.
5. Generate milestones.
6. Identify task dependencies.
7. Estimate project duration.
8. Generate deployment roadmap.
9. Produce project timeline.
10. Export roadmap documentation.

