# Error Handling

The Roadmap Agent handles several project planning scenarios.

### Missing Project Information

Requests missing details from previous AI agents before generating the roadmap.

### Unrealistic Timeline

Suggests a more achievable project schedule based on complexity.

### Dependency Conflicts

Identifies tasks that cannot begin until prerequisite tasks are completed.

### Resource Constraints

Recommends alternative technologies or revised timelines.

