# Advantages

- Automates project planning.
- Generates realistic development schedules.
- Supports Agile methodology.
- Identifies project risks early.
- Improves team coordination.
- Reduces planning effort.
- Helps monitor project progress.

---

# Limitations

- Timeline estimates depend on the accuracy of project requirements.
- Team size and developer experience may affect actual project duration.
- External dependencies (such as third-party APIs) can impact the roadmap.

